#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.selection__stock_picking_type__responsible_assign_mode__manual
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Manual"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking_type__responsible_assign_mode
msgid ""
"Manual: nothing is assigned automatically.\n"
"When the transfer is ready: assign the responsible as soon as the transfer is reserved.\n"
"Together with the previous operation: assign the responsible when the chained previous transfer (e.g. pick before pack) gets its own responsible, so both users are known from the start."
msgstr ""
"Manual: no se asigna nada automáticamente.\n"
"Cuando la transferencia está lista: asigna el responsable en cuanto la transferencia se reserva.\n"
"Junto con la operación anterior: asigna el responsable cuando la transferencia anterior encadenada (p. ej. recolección antes de empaque) recibe su responsable, para que ambos usuarios se conozcan desde el inicio."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
