#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model,name:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.model_stock_picking
msgid "Transfer"
msgstr "Transferencia"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_res_users__picking_assign_available
msgid ""
"Uncheck it when the user is absent: the automatic assignment of transfers "
"will skip this user until it is checked again."
msgstr ""
"Desmárquelo cuando el usuario esté ausente: la asignación automática de "
"transferencias lo omitirá hasta que se vuelva a marcar."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model,name:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.model_res_users
msgid "User"
msgstr "Usuario"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking_type__responsible_user_ids
msgid ""
"Internal users that receive the transfers of this operation type "
"automatically, e.g. warehouse operators restricted to their operation types. "
"The transfer goes to the user with the lowest pending workload."
msgstr ""
"Usuarios internos que reciben automáticamente las transferencias de este "
"tipo de operación, p. ej. almacenistas restringidos a sus tipos de "
"operación. La transferencia va al usuario con menor carga pendiente."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking_type__responsible_assign_load
msgid ""
"What is summed over the pending transfers of each user to pick the least "
"loaded one."
msgstr ""
"Lo que se suma sobre las transferencias pendientes de cada usuario para "
"elegir al menos cargado."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.selection__stock_picking_type__responsible_assign_mode__ready
msgid "When the transfer is ready"
msgstr "Cuando la transferencia está lista"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking_type__responsible_assign_load
msgid "Workload Measure"
msgstr "Medida de carga de trabajo"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking_type__responsible_assign_max_pending
msgid "Max Pending Transfers per User"
msgstr "Máximo de transferencias pendientes por usuario"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking_type__responsible_assign_max_pending
msgid ""
"Transfers a user can have pending at the same time. Beyond it the transfer "
"waits unassigned and is handed out when the user finishes one, so the work "
"flows as a queue. 0 means no limit."
msgstr ""
"Transferencias que un usuario puede tener pendientes al mismo tiempo. Por "
"encima de ese número la transferencia espera sin responsable y se entrega "
"cuando el usuario termina una, para que el trabajo fluya como una cola. 0 "
"significa sin límite."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking__next_picking_id
msgid "Next Operation"
msgstr "Siguiente operación"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking__next_picking_id
msgid ""
"First chained transfer that follows this one, e.g. the pack of what this "
"transfer picks."
msgstr ""
"Primera transferencia encadenada que sigue a esta, p. ej. el empaque de lo "
"que esta transferencia recolecta."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking__next_picking_user_id
msgid ""
"Responsible of the next operation, e.g. who packs what this transfer picks. "
"Changing it changes the responsible of that transfer."
msgstr ""
"Responsable de la siguiente operación, p. ej. quién empaca lo que esta "
"transferencia recolecta. Al cambiarlo cambia el responsable de esa "
"transferencia."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking__picking_progress
msgid "Progress"
msgstr "Avance"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking__picking_progress
msgid "Picked lines over the lines of the transfer."
msgstr "Líneas recolectadas sobre las líneas de la transferencia."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking__is_in_progress
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.view_picking_internal_search
msgid "In Progress"
msgstr "En proceso"

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign.field_stock_picking__is_in_progress
msgid ""
"Ready transfer where the operator already picked some lines (e.g. scanned "
"them in the barcode app) but did not validate yet."
msgstr ""
"Transferencia lista en la que el operador ya recolectó algunas líneas (p. "
"ej. las escaneó en la app de código de barras) pero todavía no la valida."

#. module: stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_picking_responsible_auto_assign/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"%(pickings)s: already in progress, change the responsible by hand if you "
"really want to take it away from %(users)s."
msgstr ""
"%(pickings)s: ya está en proceso, cambie el responsable a mano si de verdad "
"quiere quitárselo a %(users)s."
